      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>Log in to OpenShift Container Platform.</li>
      <li>
      Load the project where the service you want to expose is located.
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc project project1"} lang="terminal" title="Example command" />
      </li>
      <li>
      Open a text file on the control plane node and paste the following text into the file. Edit the file as needed.
      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: egress-2\nspec:\n  ports:\n  - name: db\n    port: 3306\n  loadBalancerIP:\n  loadBalancerSourceRanges:\n  - 10.0.0.0/8\n  - 192.168.0.0/16\n  type: LoadBalancer\n  selector:\n    name: mysql"} lang="yaml" title="Sample load balancer configuration file" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>metadata.name</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies a descriptive name for the load balancer service.</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>ports.port</code></dt>
